     "axis",
     "line graph",
     "trend"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "A line graph joins points to show how something changes over time. The horizontal axis shows time and the vertical axis shows the value.\nA rising line means the value is increasing and a falling line means it is decreasing. A flat line means no change.\nTo draw one, mark the points from the table and join them in order."
    }
